{"sections":[{"slug":"Day卷积","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Day卷积"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Day <span lang=\"zh\">卷积</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Day 卷积"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/对称幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", $\\mathcal D$ <span lang=\"zh\">余完备且</span> $\\otimes_{\\mathcal D}$ <span lang=\"zh\">保持每个分量的余极限</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则函子范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)$ <span lang=\"zh\">上有一个对称幺半范畴结构</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">称为</span> <strong>Day <span lang=\"zh\">卷积</span></strong>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">使用</span> Kan <span lang=\"zh\">扩张</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $X,Y \\in \\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)$ <span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $X \\boxtimes Y\\in \\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal C\\times\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为其外张量积</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即</span>\n$$\r\n(X\\boxtimes Y)(c,c') = X(c) \\otimes_{\\mathcal D} Y(c').\r\n$$\n$X$ <span lang=\"zh\">与</span> $Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Day <span lang=\"zh\">卷积可定义为</span> $X\\boxtimes Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">沿</span> $\\otimes_{\\mathcal C} \\colon \\mathcal C\\times\\mathcal C \\to \\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的左</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Kan扩张","text":"Kan <span lang=\"zh\">扩张</span>"}},{"Plain":":\n$$\r\nX \\otimes_{\\text{Day}} Y := \\operatorname{LKE}_{\\otimes_{\\mathcal C}} (X \\boxtimes Y),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">具体地</span>,\n$$\r\n(X \\otimes_{\\text{Day}} Y)(c) = \\operatorname{colim}_{c' \\otimes c'' \\to c} X(c') \\otimes_{\\mathcal D} Y(c'').\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p>$\\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/交换代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">交换代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/松幺半函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">松对称幺半函子</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">更一般地</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对任意</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/对称幺半∞-范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">以及</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/算畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">算畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal O$, <span lang=\"zh\">存在算畴</span> $\\mathsf{Day}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal O)$ <span lang=\"zh\">满足对任意算畴</span> $\\mathcal P$,\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathcal P}(\\mathsf{Day}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal O))\\simeq \\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathcal P\\times_{\\mathsf{Fin}_*}\\mathcal C^\\otimes}(\\mathcal O).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">换言之</span>, $\\mathsf{Day}_{\\mathcal C}$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $-\\times_{\\mathsf{Fin}_*}\\mathcal C^\\otimes$ <span lang=\"zh\">的右伴随</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}